  m_text: "<color=white>Extremely aggressive enemies and high damage. \n\nA full arsenal and extensive knowledge of the game are expected. Any slip-ups are punished harshly.</color>\n\n<b>Recommended for players who already have considerable experience with the game and are looking for a fresh challenge.</b>"
